Subject: [PATCH 2/3] test: run against the real Exa API and an ai@6/7 x
 zod@3/4 install matrix

No API key needed: a deliberately invalid key gets a real 401 INVALID_API_KEY. Request bodies are validated against https://exa.ai/docs/exa-spec.json with ajv and checked for fields the spec marks deprecated or legacy. test/compat/run.mjs packs the package, installs it with plain npm install into fresh projects for each ai/zod pair, type-checks the docs example, and drives the tool through generateText with the AI SDK test model. --baseline runs the same matrix against the published 2.1.0.
